ta-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307003/一技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307003/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307003/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307003/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307003/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307003/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307003/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">当伽菈波那选手走上赛场之时，许多人都好奇：一名沉稳克制的学者，为何投入这项奔放的运动？<br />在天文学的研究中，那颗你注视许久的星星，或许在闪烁的光芒传到镜筒中之前，早已于现实中死去。那颗原本自由的星星，在被恒星令人窒息的引力捕获后，便不再有逃逸的可能。正如一名伟大学者所说，如果月亮被赋予了自由意志，它也会认为，自己是自愿进行着那永恒的运动。<br />而在赛场上，每一次回旋，每一次飞跃，每一次围绕原点的往复运动，都是出于自己的意志，都是为了下一次的动作更加完美。作为教练，笃笃骨或许格外严苛，但她教会了伽菈波那：尽管个人的选择和努力不能改变自然规律，但它们仍旧有其意义。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"307003\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307004.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/fd/Belonging-307004.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">专业体操服<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Gymnastic Leotard</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />25<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>专业运动员所选择的体操服，采用最优质面料制作而成，质地光滑而贴身。<br />大量的镂空设计是点睛之笔。“让我每一个动作都变得更加完美。”受访者如此坦言。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307005.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/12/Belonging-307005.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">防护贴布 <div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Athletic Tape</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.25<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一卷普通的运动用贴布，价廉而可靠，追求单一而有效的功能性。<br />它完全符合受访者“能用就行”的节能派主义。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307006.png\" src=\"https://hui